+*   `ScreenLinePixels`: Array of `W_PIXELS` (default 64) `Option<PixelColor>` (u32 RGBA).
+*   `ScreenLineAddr`: Struct containing `screen_idx` (usize) and `addr` (u32) for depth sorting.
 
